{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Njuma?</strong></h2><br><strong>Njuma</strong> is a narrative driven pixel art game with an offbeat interpretation of the Game Jam\u2019s theme: <strong>Take a Deep Breath.</strong><br><br>Draw your last breath and become the family's Spirit-Guide and <strong>Guardian of the Ancestral Tree</strong>. Help your descendents in their final moments by bringing them comfort and serenity as they transition to the afterlife.<br><br>The Ancestral Tree withers, generational trauma lurking in its shadow. You must piece together a tragedy and soothe a soul-scar which refuses to heal. The Fate of the family is in your hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can expect</strong></h2><br>A short walking simulator game, where you interact and get help from items and NPC's in the environment to interpret the story.<br><br>The NPC's interact with you as you walk close to objects, giving you clues of what they are seeking.<br><br>Pick up items, and place them to make a choice. Your choice matters!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About development</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743320/extras/d36ed4d351f1b1d3492ed56103920209.avif?t=1706256792\" width=97 height=123 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743320/extras/ae025d926a3a51c6cd66d774842d4d67.avif?t=1706256792\" width=81 height=126 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743320/extras/d725fe47df4d6f7623fe9a580f9d39bf.avif?t=1706256792\" width=92 height=115 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743320/extras/7a1dc7394408d489dfa31d8ea12a4dc3.avif?t=1706256792\" width=86 height=113 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743320/extras/ec109bc8491d44849ffbf7cffd596a3e.avif?t=1706256792\" width=80 height=128 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a submission for the Lv. 99 Game Jam in 2023. It was developed in the span of 10 days, and worked on further for 3 days for an update including bugfixes and a dialogue system unlocked by completing the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743320/extras/2e1f7c49aeb76411576100e352e64ad9.poster.avif?t=1706256792\" width=630 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743320/extras/2e1f7c49aeb76411576100e352e64ad9.webm?t=1706256792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743320/extras/2e1f7c49aeb76411576100e352e64ad9.mp4?t=1706256792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Persie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743320/4ea902e1a0dc8372d2f042e9f02de84df67760fa.jpg"},{"name":"Devmode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743320/4ea902e1a0dc8372d2f042e9f02de84df67760fa.jpg"},{"name":"New Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743320/4ea902e1a0dc8372d2f042e9f02de84df67760fa.jpg"},{"name":"Withering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743320/4ea902e1a0dc8372d2f042e9f02de84df67760fa.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2743320?t=1706256792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1706256792","capsule_ima